88-S1-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션) · 객관식 3번","searchText":" 03\n\n원통형 자성체의 지름이 2cm, 길이가 0.5m, 자화의\n세기가 300m일 때, 자극의 세기는 몇 인가?\n\n\n①          ② \n\n③          ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e10-m03","number":3},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m03-q.webp","width":678,"height":517},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m03-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1402}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P088-S1-Q04","number":4,"question":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션) · 객관식 4번","searchText":" 04\n\n동심구형 콘덴서에서 내구의 반지름이 0.1m, 외구의\n내측반지름이 0.2m, 외측반지름이 0.25m, 내구\n\n와 외구사이에 채워진 매질의 비유전율이 9일 때, 동심구형\n\n콘덴서의 정전용량은 몇 F인가?\n\n\n① ×        ② × \n③ ×        ④ × \n⑤ × ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e10-m04","number":4},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m04-q.webp","width":696,"height":691},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m04-e1.webp","width":696,"height":433},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m04-e2.webp","width":678,"height":1243}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P088-S1-Q05","number":5,"question":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션) · 객관식 5번","searchText":" 05\n\n도체구 , , , 가 병렬 연결될 때 합성 정전용량이\nF이고 각 도체구의 반지름이 각각 m,\n\nm, m라면, 의 반지름은 몇 m인가?\n\n\n① 1           ② 2\n\n③ 3           ④ 4\n\n⑤ 5","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e10-m05","number":5},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m05-q.webp","width":696,"height":608},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m05-e1.webp","width":678,"height":641}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P088-S1-Q06","number":6,"question":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션) · 객관식 6번","searchText":" 06\n\n°C에서 저항이 Ω, Ω이고 저항온도계수가 각각\n\n, 인 두 개의 저항선을 직렬로 접속하였을\n경우에 합성 저항온도계수가 일 때, 는 몇 Ω\n\n인가?\n\n\n\n\n① 16          ② 20\n\n③ 24          ④ 36\n\n⑤ 40","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e10-m06","number":6},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m06-q.webp","width":696,"height":537},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m06-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1881}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P088-S1-Q07","number":7,"question":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션) · 객관식 7번","searchText":" 07\n\n반지름이 각각 m, m인 두 개의 도체구 사이의 중심\n\n거리가 m일 때, 두 도체구 사이의 저항은 몇 Ω인가?\n\n(단, 도체구 사이의 도전율은 Ω･m이다.)\n\n\n                            \n①            ②     \n\n                            \n③            ④     \n\n    \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e10-m07","number":7},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m07-q.webp","width":678,"height":657},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m07-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1531}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P088-S1-Q08","number":8,"question":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션) · 객관식 8번","searchText":" 08\n\n평등자계 ATm내에 자계와 30°의 각도로 자극의 세\n기가 , 길이가 0.5m인 막대 자성체가 놓여 있을\n때, 자성체의 토크가 0.1N･m였다. 이 때의 평등자계\n\nATm는?\n\n\n                            \n①            ②        \n\n                           \n③           ④ \n\n   \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.06.21 한전 KDN (휴스테이션)","originalId":"2025p2-e10-m08","number":8},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m08-q.webp","width":678,"height":696},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m08-e1.webp","width":678,"height":351},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e10-m08-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1290}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P088-S1-Q09